think r1 (fold identical), r2 (travels), r3 (bound win) landed and sent over Knots sealed in code. The design read named r4 as the closing rung: read a real on-disk format cord-knot-v1 record, cross-checked against an independent reading — two tools, one answer.
think Built the r4 trio mirroring the elder cord_true / cord_batch_true pattern: mycelium/cord_knot_fixture_gen.rye seats the honest four-fact history (two genesis issues, a tax, a star reserve — supply 700, one star vega), seals it to a Knot, and renders the Knot to a format cord-knot-v1 record on stderr (the toolchain's print convention). tools/fixtures/cord_knot.bron holds it; a mycelium/corpora/ symlink @embedFile-binds it; tools/fixtures/cord_knot_truth.awk reads it independently.
think A Knot record is simple (issued · taxed · one hex star line per reserved star · digest), so the truth awk computes supply = issued - taxed and counts star lines, printing the pair `<supply> <stars>`. mycelium/cord_knot_true.rye @embedFiles the fixture, parses via r2, verifies the recovered Knot against its own digest (a real record's digest matches its sealed state), and reports supply·stars; the witness cross-checks that pair against awk.
obs The crux on metal: the app's pair equals awk's reading of the same bytes — both `700 1` — so a checkpointed history can never drift from facts a keeper adds up by hand. Genuineness beyond the pair: the record verifies against its own digest, re-renders to the embedded bytes exactly (fixed point), the recovered Knot continues to a lawful supply (a fresh 300 issue → issued 1300), the generator re-emits byte-identical bytes (REPRODUCIBLE), and a tampered header refuses BadFormat.
obs GREEN first pass; app==awk `700 1`. TAME bans clean, width-check exit 0. Additive — composes cord_knot + cord_knot_bron + fold public API only; r2 and r3 both re-run GREEN at the witness door. Demo keeper seeds only — no key/funds/network/custody.
obs The Mycelium checkpointing arc stands complete end to end — r1 fold identical · r2 travels · r3 bound win · r4 reads true. This is the fourth closed 4-round arc on the Mycelium road (Cord · gossip convergence · fact batching · checkpointing), each proving a distinct promise of a bounded, leaderless, custody-first civic consensus.
